rel('nhai-chapwa-allegation','nhai','ganeshgarhia','Alleged unrecorded toll and false exemption entry','NHAI alleged its inspection vehicle paid ₹50 on ingress without a receipt and was entered as exempt, while the return transaction was recorded. NHAI said bypassing ETC impaired its contractual entitlement to 50% of the specified non-FASTag collections. The court reserved the underlying factual issues.',CH,T,'2025-02-08',['chapwa-toll-debarment','chapwa-money-stages'],['chapwa-company-response','chapwa-court-outcome'],[cash],tier='alleged',kind='contractual-fraud-allegation',status='Disputed NHAI allegation; debarment later set aside; facts not finally adjudicated',asof='2025-12-11',states=['UP'],alts=['Contractor described a local-resident exchange/exemption and relied on the properly recorded return trip as inconsistent with systematic evasion.'],limits=['No aggregate loss or ₹25 actual loss is calculated from the contractual percentage. The inspection amount does not prove a wider national network.'])
